"Path-finder used for smart append. HessianRidgeness is polarity-agnostic; HighGround biases toward ridges only." = "智能追加采用的路径搜索算法。HessianRidgeness 不区分特征极性；HighGround 仅偏向脊线。";
"Douglas–Peucker tolerance applied to the walker output, in screen pixels." = "对搜索路径应用 Douglas–Peucker 简化的容差，单位为屏幕像素。";
"Maximum straight-line A→B distance in screen pixels before the handler bails to vanilla append." = "A→B 的最大屏幕直线距离；超过后改用普通追加方式。";
"Skip A* recompute when the cursor has moved less than this many pixels since the last frame." = "与上一帧相比，光标移动不足此像素距离时不重新执行 A* 搜索。";
"Ridge preference weight. 0 = straight-line; higher values track ridges harder." = "脊线偏好权重。0 表示直线；值越大，路径越倾向于跟随脊线。";
"Multiplier on straight-line distance used to gate runaway A* search." = "以直线距离的倍数限制过长的 A* 搜索路径。";
"Radius in grid cells used to snap the cursor target to the highest nearby cell." = "将光标目标捕捉到附近最高网格时采用的搜索半径。";
"Frangi anisotropy weight. Standard value is 0.5; lower values penalize plate-like responses harder." = "Frangi 各向异性权重。标准值为 0.5；值越小，对板状响应的惩罚越强。";
