"Multiplier on Euclidean distance used to gate off-feature meander before A* gives up. Default 100.0." = "用于限制偏离特征绕行的欧氏距离倍数，超过后终止 A* 搜索，默认 100.0。";
"Floor on the A* expansion budget regardless of Euclidean distance. Default 250 000." = "不论欧氏距离大小，A* 搜索至少允许的展开次数，默认 250 000。";
"Per-pixel scale on the A* expansion budget above the floor. Default 500." = "最小次数以外，按欧氏距离每像素增加的 A* 展开次数，默认 500。";
"Hard cap on Euclidean distance (in cells) before the Hessian walker bails without building its feature surface." = "海森路径搜索允许的最大欧氏距离，单位为网格；超过后不构建特征场。";
"Where the split occurs on an arc. Alt swaps to the non-default mode." = "弧线拆分位置。按住 Option 可切换到非默认拆分方式。";
"Douglas-Peucker tolerance; larger = more aggressive simplification." = "Douglas–Peucker 简化容差；值越大，简化程度越高。";
