"Distance between the input polyline and each offset, in map units." = "输入折线到各偏移线的距离，单位为地图单位。";
"Which bank(s) to emit, relative to the direction the input line is drawn in." = "相对于输入线的绘制方向，选择输出左侧、右侧或两侧偏移线。";
"Also emit a line across each end, connecting the offsets." = "在每个端部生成连接偏移线的连线。";
"Leave the clicked polyline in place instead of replacing it with its offsets." = "保留点击的原始折线，不以偏移线替换它。";
"Number of neighboring points averaged together. Larger values produce smoother results." = "每次参与平均的相邻点数；值越大，结果越平滑。";
"How many times to repeat the moving average." = "重复移动平均平滑的次数。";
"Distance between sample points (in map units). Smaller = more precise but slower." = "采样点间距，单位为地图单位；值越小，精度越高，速度越慢。";
"Perpendicular: search across the line direction. Radial: search in all directions." = "垂直方向表示沿线的法向搜索；径向表示向所有方向搜索。";
"Snap to the highest or lowest sampled elevation." = "捕捉到采样高程的最高值或最低值。";
