"Moves face points around randomly based on a jitter parameter" = "根据抖动参数随机移动单元顶点。";
"Nudges computational nodes to reduce cell skew, closer to equiangular." = "微调计算节点，减小单元偏斜，使各内角趋于一致。";
"Supports two distinct topological operations, merge and collapse, based on a cost function set with parameters." = "根据参数定义的代价函数，执行合并和折叠两种拓扑操作。";
"Improves cell orthogonality such that faces are closer to perpendicular to the line between adjacent cell centers." = "改善单元正交性，使公共边更接近垂直于相邻单元中心的连线。";
"The opposite of Split, combining adjacent triangles into a quad by removing their shared face" = "通过移除相邻三角形的公共边，将其合并为四边形。";
"The opposite of Split, and will combine adjacent triangles into a quadrilateral" = "将相邻三角形合并为四边形，与拆分操作对应。";
"Merges 4 cells around a node, producing 2 cells" = "合并节点周围的四个单元，得到两个单元。";
"Applies Zhou and Shimada angle-based smoothing" = "应用 Zhou 和 Shimada 的角度平滑方法。";
"Replaces computational nodes with the average of their adjacent node locations" = "将计算节点移到相邻节点位置的平均值。";
"Splits quads into two triangles based on an orthogonality threshold" = "根据正交性阈值，将四边形拆分为两个三角形。";
"Replaces the common face of a pair of adjacent triangles with a face connecting the two other points" = "替换相邻三角形的公共边，改为连接另外两个顶点。";
"Unknown Ingredient - could not parse this ingredient (did you import an invalid string?)" = "未知操作：无法解析此操作，请检查导入的配置字符串。";
"How much variance the points move around by" = "节点随机移动的幅度。";
"-1: Moves points without regard to concavity. 0: Avoids concave cells, but may create collinear faces. 0>: Additionally nudges towards the point." = "-1：移动时不考虑凹性；0：避免凹单元，但可能产生共线边；正值：额外向该点微调。";
"The number of repeated passes. Higher values will do more nudging, at the expense of mesh computation time." = "重复次数。数值越大，微调次数越多，网格计算耗时也越长。";
"Lower bound on the cost function for considering a change. (0.5 is a reasonable default given default weights)" = "考虑拓扑变更的代价函数下限。在默认权重下，0.5 是合理的默认值。";
"Toggle for merge operation consideration" = "是否考虑合并操作。";
"Can be set to false to avoid operating on nodes along the arc of the conceptual mesh" = "关闭后，不处理概念网格弧线上的节点。";
"Set the weight of skew; what mesh quality is required to be considered for operation" = "偏斜权重：设置允许操作的网格质量条件。";
"Set the weight of cell area; what cell area range is considered for operation" = "单元面积权重：设置允许操作的面积范围。";
"Set the weight of face smoothing; how smooth the geometry needs to be to be considered for operation" = "边平滑权重：设置允许操作的几何平滑度条件。";
"Set the weight of face length; how long the face can be to be considered for operation" = "边长权重：设置允许操作的单元边长条件。";
"Number of top-level iterations" = "外层迭代次数。";
