"How the smoothing update is computed" = "平滑更新的计算方法。";
"Scales the relative contributions of orthogonalization and smoiothing vectors according to a function" = "按函数调整正交化向量和平滑向量的相对贡献。";
"Threshhold for merging quads." = "合并四边形的阈值。";
"Threshold for collapsing a node, based on a cost function" = "根据代价函数确定的节点折叠阈值。";
"The number of smoothing iterations." = "平滑迭代次数。";
"The number of repeated passes. Higher values will do more smoothing, at the expense of mesh computation time" = "重复次数。数值越大，平滑次数越多，网格计算耗时也越长。";
"If true, adjust the smoothing to try to maintain the target length of faces. In areas of sharp gradients in the size function this generally gives better results. When false, a straight average of adjacent nodes is used" = "启用时，平滑过程会尽量保持目标边长，在尺寸函数梯度较大的区域通常效果更好。关闭时，直接采用相邻节点的平均位置。";
"If true, smoothing will also apply to boundary nodes (along arcs). If false, only non-boundary nodes are adjusted. Even with sliding set to true, nodes will not be moved if a neighboring region is expected but not yet present. For example, when smoothing a region, nodes along a perimeter can be adjusted, but nodes shared by 2 regions will not be moved. If applied globally then nodes shared between two regions can be adjusted, but nodes of the conceptual mesh are still treated as fixed." = "启用时，也会平滑弧线上的边界节点；关闭时，只调整内部节点。若相邻区域尚未生成，共享边界上的节点仍不会移动。单区域平滑可调整外边界节点，但不移动两区域的共享节点；全局平滑可以调整共享节点，概念网格节点始终固定。";
